[00:00.000] 作曲 : Jojo Orme
[00:03.118][Verse 1]
[01:12.827]Run down a hall, into the sun
[01:16.758]Shimmer of glaze, how you begun
[01:20.811]All these years, still think of the time
[01:24.758]We met eyes, then you were mine
[01:28.209]
[01:28.748]'Til you confess how you begun
[01:32.789]How you begun, what you have left
[01:36.741]Stairs of the night, we were as one
[01:40.782]Playing a game, just having fun
[01:44.176][Chorus]
[01:44.177]All of this emotion, who is to blame?
[01:47.654]Rules of passion, does a romance say what you say?
[01:51.795]Body is a temple and a temper in the mind
[01:55.819]Fish learned to walk, now they know to say hello
[01:59.769][Verse 2]
[01:59.771]Corner to corner, I wait for your gaze
[02:03.719]Look through your eyes, go with the daze
[02:07.820]'Til nothing more, I had to begin
[02:11.814]We are friends, just let me in
[02:15.810][Pre-Chorus]
[02:15.828]I want to run away with you
[02:29.833]Two can be
[02:37.817]Two can win
[02:40.170][Chorus]
[02:40.190]All of this emotion, who is to blame?
[02:43.647]Rules of passion, does a romance say what you say?
[02:47.771]Body is a temple and a temper in the mind
[02:51.685]Fish learned to walk, now they know to say hello, now
[02:55.952][Bridge]
[03:26.682]I don't have a chance to ask for a dance from you
[03:34.826]I'm so shy, it pains me to ask you to save me too
[03:42.675]I don't have a chance to ask for a dance from you
[03:51.193]I'm so shy, it pains me to ask you to save me too
[03:58.807]Think I'll die
[04:06.956]When you die, I'll die, a mutual sigh
[04:11.329]With your hand in mine
[04:13.349]The flame fades pale
[04:15.766]The flame fades pale
[04:17.733]The flame fades pale
[04:22.471][Outro]
[04:26.018]All I want to do is dance, dance, dance
